---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Engineering Projects"
  description="The Engineering Platform behind James Roberts' infrastructure portfolio."
>
  <section class="projects-hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Engineering Portfolio</p>
        <h1>
          One platform.
          <span>Built in layers.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-summary">
          This portfolio follows the engineering platform I actually operate.
          The platform is the main project; individual technologies become
          deeper case studies as they are introduced, configured and proven.
        </p>
        <div class="button-row">
          <a class="button button-primary" href="/projects/engineering-platform">
            Explore the Engineering Platform
          </a>
          <a class="button button-secondary" href="/projects/proxmox-platform">
            Proxmox Platform
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="platform-facts">
        <p class="eyebrow">Current Focus</p>
        <dl>
          <div><dt>Primary project</dt><dd>Engineering Platform</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Virtualisation</dt><dd>Proxmox VE cluster</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Approach</dt><dd>Build → prove → document</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Portfolio state</dt><dd class="status-live">Actively evolving</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-soft">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Platform Map</p>
        <h2>Start with the whole platform, then drill into the engineering.</h2>
        <p>
          The main case study explains how the environment fits together.
          Technology pages sit underneath it and document the implementation
          in more detail.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="platform-path">
        <a class="platform-card primary-card" href="/projects/engineering-platform">
          <span class="card-label">01 · Main Project</span>
          <h3>The Platform Behind This Website</h3>
          <p>
            The current architecture, public delivery, infrastructure,
            observability, security, automation and operational approach.
          </p>
          <strong>Explore Engineering Platform →</strong>
        </a>

        <div class="path-connector" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>

        <a class="platform-card" href="/projects/proxmox-platform">
          <span class="card-label">02 · Platform Deep Dive</span>
          <h3>Proxmox VE Cluster Platform</h3>
          <p>
            Two-node virtualisation, quorum, Corosync networking, LXC and QEMU
            workloads, backup, recovery and infrastructure operations.
          </p>
          <strong>Explore Proxmox →</strong>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container future-panel">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">What Comes Next</p>
        <h2>The portfolio grows with the platform.</h2>
        <p>
          Additional technology deep dives will appear here when they are part
          of the current platform and there is real implementation and
          operational evidence to show.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a class="button button-secondary" href="/projects/engineering-platform">
        View current architecture
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .projects-hero {
    padding: 7rem 0 5rem;
  }

  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.35fr) minmax(300px, 0.65fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4rem;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 8vw, 6rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    line-height: 0.96;
  }

  h1 span {
    display: block;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .hero-summary {
    max-width: 760px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .platform-facts {
    padding: 1.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--surface);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }

  .platform-facts dl { margin: 0; }

  .platform-facts dl div {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.15rem;
    padding: 0.8rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .platform-facts dl div:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }

  .platform-facts dt {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .platform-facts dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .status-live { color: #8ff0bc; }

  .platform-path {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .platform-card {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--surface);
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    transition: transform 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease;
  }

  .platform-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    border-color: rgba(93, 184, 255, 0.5);
  }

  .primary-card {
    border-color: rgba(93, 184, 255, 0.4);
  }

  .card-label {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .platform-card h3 {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0.75rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }

  .platform-card p {
    max-width: 720px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .platform-card strong { color: var(--primary); }

  .path-connector {
    padding: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
  }

  .future-panel {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4rem;
    padding: 2.5rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(93, 184, 255, 0.35);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .future-panel h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1.08;
  }

  .future-panel p {
    max-width: 760px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 950px) {
    .hero-grid,
    .future-panel {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
